    "detailed_description": "It's Sara's first day of work.<br>However, when she takes the elevator to go to the office, she suddenly finds herself on a <strong>mysterious floor</strong>.<br>What <strong>truth</strong> lies behind these weird rooms?<br>Will you be able to move on? Or rather... will you <strong>want</strong> to move on?<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Play as Sara, a 24-year-old girl.<br></li><li>Explore mysterious rooms.<br></li><li>Interact with people with familiar faces.<br></li><li>Collect key fragments.<br></li><li>Find a way to leave this place.</li></ul>",
